Z||000000||Spektrum-87GT||09-23-2001||12:17 AM||||i was just reading over my rodney dickman catalog and it said that 'the original gm catalytic converter is very restrictive and a nice horsepower gain is achieved when it is replaced by a freer flowing unit' i live in virginia... with no emissions laws... i'm hacking the muffler and adding resonated tips... wondering if i should hack the cat while i'm at it, would you guys do it?||||reg||1
