Z||000015||rx7speed||09-25-2001||04:48 AM||||only thing I have to say about running a cat on a car is try to shove a tennis ball with a few small holes in it to act as a cat and then shove it up your arse eat a bowl of chilli and then fart your socks off.<P>I bet you are going to work a lot harder and end up with one sore arse doing that.<P>or look at it this way<BR>when having sex do you want to use that big bulky condom? gets in the way. makes you work a little harder... now lets move up to the high flow cat also known as a sensative condom.. sure may be a little more fun and still keeps things clean but wouldn't you like to rip that thing off and just go at it full force and screw the mess it makes<P>well I guess I shoud shut up now<P>I am really tired and not watching what I am saying<P><P>------------------<BR>who needs pistons I have rotary<P>||||reg||7
